hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18217","Ali ibn Ayyash and Isam ibn Khalid narrated to us, they said: Hariz narrated to us, he said: Nimran ibn Mikhmar narrated to me, and Isam said Ibn Muhbir, from Shurahbil ibn Aws, and he was from the Companions of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), that he said: The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Whoever drinks wine flog him, and if he returns flog him, and if he returns flog him, and if he returns kill him."
